# SPA fallback: all routes serve index.html so Vue Router can resolve them.
# Needed because Netlify alias deploys (the per-PR `pr-N--` aliases published by
# .github/workflows/preview.yml via actions-netlify) do not apply the
# netlify.toml [[redirects]] rule. Shipping the rule inside dist/_redirects
# (via Vite's public/ → dist/ copy) makes Netlify honor it for every deploy
# variant — production, branch deploys, and alias deploys.
/*  /index.html  200
